makeup with a touch of cinnabar red lips. Jade jewelry accents.\n\n**Environment:** A serene classical courtyard under moonlight. Ethereal white fog surrounds the scene. Background features ink-wash style silhouettes of bamboo or rocks, creating depth and poetic mystery. \n\n**Lighting:** Cool moonlight as the main source, casting soft shadows and highlighting the matte skin texture. Warm ambient light from distant paper lanterns provides a subtle color contrast. Soft backlighting through the sheer fabric creates a dreamy glow.\n\n**Typography:** The Chinese characters \"芒种\" (Mangzhong) in vertical calligraphy style, positioned elegantly on the side with an ink-splash effect and seal-stamp layout. Colors: Deep indigo or cinnabar red.\n\n**Color Palette:** Moon white, lotus pink, dark blue, cinnabar red, gold accents. \n\n**Style:** Oriental aesthetics, cinematic lighting, New Chinese style business KTV vibe, elegant, pure desire (chunyu) style"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 10, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 13, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "💬回复文本", "links": [10, 20], "label": "💬回复文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "💬回复文本"}, {"name": "📋完整对话历史", "label": "📋完整对话历史", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "📋完整对话历史"}, {"name": "🔢使用的种子", "label": "🔢使用的种子", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "🔢使用的种子"}], "size": [549.27197265625, 863.25439453125], "pos": [2883.875244140625, 1798.2171630859375], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive-Q4_K_M.gguf", "Qwen3.5", "mmproj-Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive-f16.gguf", 8192, -1, 256, 1344, "我要设计一张图片海报，帮我优化提示词的细节和排版(只要出一个方案，内容里不要有任何尺寸信息，不要过度暴露，不要低俗，不要色情，皮肤要真实和哑光，保持高级感和想象空间。)", "", "one by one", 10, 1120, 0, "随机种子", 1024, 0.7, 0.9, 40, 1.1, false, false, false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7,